{"id": "FF-fc7d736ba76a98ed", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "9.已知函数f(x)={ln(−x),x<0,; x^(2)−3x−4,x>0,}则函数y=f(x)的零点是　　　　　　.", "explanation": "依题意，{x<0,; ln(−x)=0}或{x>0,; x^(2)−3x−4=0,}\n解得x=-1或x=4.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K013", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["zero_analysis"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.10　函数的零点与方程的解.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.10　函数的零点与方程的解", "source_question_number": "9.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 257–260", "source_sha256": "7da9bcec0a87e2c967224ca7ddab30c91eb45feb64b580942293fc9a92808b12", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "-1和4", "accepted_answers": ["-1和4"], "answer_type": "text", "raw_answer": "-1和4", "fingerprint": "9ce69472dd6452109540e5d08e9cd0aecf958cbf7706595e001679c1ced372b1", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-c16e608dfffdb707", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "(2)已知函数f(x)为定义在(0，+∞)上的单调函数，且f(f(x)-log_(2)x-2x)=3，若函数g(x)=f(x)-a在(1，2)内有唯一零点，则实数a的取值范围是　　　　　　.", "explanation": "因为f(x)为单调函数，\n∴存在唯一实数t，使f(t)=3，\n令t=f(x)-log_(2)x-2x，∴f(x)=log_(2)x+2x+t，\n又f(t)=log_(2)t+3t=3，∴t=1，\n∴f(x)=log_(2)x+2x+1，\n∴g(x)=log_(2)x+2x+1-a在(1，2)内有唯一零点，\n又g(x)在(1，2)上单调递增，\n∴{g(1)<0,; g(2)>0,}则{3−a<0,; 6−a>0,}∴3<a<6，\n故实数a的取值范围是(3，6).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K014", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用", "source_question_number": "(2)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 94–104", "source_sha256": "7b1851320c542276a55bb3d4b6ab48c9f5e4effdf12980cb5cb95b9ae125d796", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(3,6)", "accepted_answers": ["(3,6)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(3，6)", "fingerprint": "0d0f3127e996dea40a199f251f85ee59808a7e8d6c7cf752954b9b8e9e275ef4", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-cf99b58e86b40653", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "8.(2026·沈阳期中)已知池塘中的荷花每经过一天的生长，荷叶覆盖水面面积都是前一天的(5)/(4)倍，若荷叶经过20天可以完全长满池塘水面，则当荷叶刚好覆盖水面面积一半时，荷叶大约生长了　　　　天.(参考数据：lg 2≈0.3)", "explanation": "设荷叶覆盖水面的初始面积为a，\n则经过x天荷叶覆盖水面的面积y=a·((5)/(4))^(x)(x∈N^(*))，\n由题意得2a·((5)/(4))^(x)=a·((5)/(4))^(20)，即2^(41-2x)=5^(20-x)，\n两边取以10为底的对数得(41-2x)lg 2=(20-x)lg 5，\n所以(41-2x)×0.3=(20-x)×0.7，\n解得x=17，故当荷叶刚好覆盖水面面积一半时，荷叶大约生长了17天.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K015", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "modeling"], "method_tags": ["function_model"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.12　函数模型的应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.12　函数模型的应用", "source_question_number": "8.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 307–314", "source_sha256": "c0572c0a6b8e21e851bf0fa393f9e3792e048cf9774176514d12df2c03d555d7", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "17", "accepted_answers": ["17"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "17", "fingerprint": "63c6dae38853eaa134082352854e423a89ea8d41793611ba8ad05b20765808eb", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
