{"id": "FF-e3dff474ed9bf604", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "10.已知函数f(x)={ln(x+1),x≥0,; −2x^(2),x<0,}则不等式f(x+2)<f(x^(2)+2x)的解集是　　　　　　　　　　.", "explanation": "函数f(x)={ln(x+1),x≥0,; −2x^(2),x<0,}\n显然y=ln(x+1)在[0，+∞)上单调递增，y=-2x^(2)在(-∞，0)上单调递增，\n且ln(0+1)=-2×0^(2)=0，所以f(x)在R上单调递增，\n不等式f(x+2)<f(x^(2)+2x)可化为x+2<x^(2)+2x，\n即x^(2)+x-2>0，解得x>1或x<-2，\n则原不等式的解集为(-∞，-2)∪(1，+∞).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "10.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 301–308", "source_sha256": "4a4da4a043a4a5f8afa3779129d634179d1dad121b475e710a0733c1cb0f34fb", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(-∞,-2)∪(1,+∞)", "accepted_answers": ["(-∞,-2)∪(1,+∞)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(-∞，-2)∪(1，+∞)", "fingerprint": "ba29d877ca53d928a58131acfa1c0afee261d2ac0f2fea144dbb0de6155aeb90", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
