{"id": "FF-9f3be03c9fefd6b9", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "8.(2025·八省联考)已知曲线C：y=x^(3)-(2)/(x)，两条直线l_(1)，l_(2)均过坐标原点O，l_(1)和C交于M，N两点，l_(2)和C交于P，Q两点.若△OPM的面积为sqrt(2)，则△MNQ的面积为　　　　.", "explanation": "因为函数y=x^(3)-(2)/(x)为奇函数，所以曲线C的图象关于原点对称，又两条直线l_(1)和l_(2)均过坐标原点O，则P，Q关于原点对称，M，N关于原点对称，则四边形PNQM为平行四边形.又S_(△OPM)=sqrt(2)，则S_(△MNQ)=2sqrt(2).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K006", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K005"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K005"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性", "source_question_number": "8.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 265–267", "source_sha256": "25d7a7bc92d4bc1b26b7b8da5051d6538bd27288a37b004ba4235b042f40b32f", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "2sqrt(2)", "accepted_answers": ["2sqrt(2)"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "2sqrt(2)", "fingerprint": "c70af4cf26ef4ba3f4b9aee4083e837918fe6d2b17ab027865ee4d826a46cea2", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-eee2cdb2908e4763", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "9.(2025·昭通模拟)已知幂函数f(x)=(m^(2)-3m+3)x^(m)的图象关于y轴对称，且函数g(x)=f(x)-2ax在区间[1，3]上单调递减，则实数a的取值范围是　　　　　.", "explanation": "因为函数f(x)=(m^(2)-3m+3)x^(m)是幂函数，则m^(2)-3m+3=1，解得m=1或m=2.\n当m=1时，f(x)=x，该函数是奇函数，不符合题意；\n当m=2时，f(x)=x^(2)，该函数是定义域为R的偶函数，符合题意.\n所以f(x)=x^(2)，则g(x)=x^(2)-2ax，其对称轴方程为x=a.\n因为g(x)在区间[1，3]上单调递减，则a≥3.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K005", "K008"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K005", "K008"], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "9.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 294–300", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "[3,+∞)", "accepted_answers": ["[3,+∞)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "[3，+∞)", "fingerprint": "1a284afe61b19d7d8aed06a50f4e9d1733139650b4d1811f4553f8dd833a6cbd", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
