{"id": "FF-5b488606b9b7eed8", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "14.(2025·梅州模拟)设f(x)是定义在(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)上的奇函数，对任意的x_(1)，x_(2)∈(0，+∞)，x_(1)≠x_(2)，都满足(x_(2)f(x_(2))−x_(1)f(x_(1)))/(x_(2)−x_(1))>0，且f(2)=4，则不等式f(x)-(8)/(x)>0的解集为　　　　　　　　.", "explanation": "令F(x)=xf(x)，x≠0，\n∵对任意的x_(1)，x_(2)∈(0，+∞)，x_(1)≠x_(2)，都有(x_(2)f(x_(2))−x_(1)f(x_(1)))/(x_(2)−x_(1))>0，\n∴F(x)=xf(x)在(0，+∞)上单调递增，\n又F(-x)=-xf(-x)=xf(x)=F(x)，\n∴F(x)为偶函数，\n∴F(x)在(-∞，0)上单调递减，\n又f(2)=4，则F(2)=2f(2)=8，\n∴f(x)-(8)/(x)=(xf(x)−8)/(x)=(F(x)−F(2))/(x)>0，\n当x>0时，F(x)-F(2)>0，\n即F(x)>F(2)，∴x>2，\n当x<0时，F(x)-F(2)<0，\n即F(x)<F(2)=F(-2)，∴-2<x<0，\n综上所述，f(x)-(8)/(x)>0的解集为(-2，0)∪(2，+∞).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质", "source_question_number": "14.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 143–158", "source_sha256": "8a3090a0ac7a0b0ea1eb450da245b9f84fa595720e72110c6519840779682806", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(-2,0)∪(2,+∞)", "accepted_answers": ["(-2,0)∪(2,+∞)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(-2，0)∪(2，+∞)", "fingerprint": "1af193516b4c31ec7cf9e1093e80989ccd24a2f1f8ee91cd42ea6d8094dd1786", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-9f6ffa3bee016a63", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "13.(2025·铜川模拟)设函数f(x)=log_(0.5)(ax-x^(2))在区间(0，1)上单调递减，则实数a的取值范围是　　　　　.", "explanation": "设t=ax-x^(2)，则其图象开口向下，对称轴为直线x=(a)/(2)，\n∵y=log_(0.5)t是减函数，\n∴要使f(x)在区间(0，1)上单调递减，\n则t=ax-x^(2)在区间(0，1)上单调递增且恒大于0，\n∴(a)/(2)≥1，即a≥2，\n故实数a的取值范围是[2，+∞).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数", "source_question_number": "13.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 120–127", "source_sha256": "e787e0fd585e547b1af86d7e786b3f1449f337a3875adc1e700bbca67406f78d", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "[2,+∞)", "accepted_answers": ["[2,+∞)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "[2，+∞)", "fingerprint": "b3387b216bb8357d7c7f34f067676b6b4ccdf6ad8c546c5d73c624bf5d2496d5", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-e574bbcb76610f30", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "12.已知x_(0)是函数f(x)=ln x-x+2的零点，则e^(x_(0)−2)-x_(0)+3=　　　　.", "explanation": "由题意可得f(x_(0))=ln x_(0)-x_(0)+2=0，即ln x_(0)=x_(0)-2，\n则e^(x_(0)−2)=x_(0)，故e^(x_(0)−2)-x_(0)+3=x_(0)-x_(0)+3=3.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K013", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["zero_analysis"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题4　函数与方程.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题4　函数与方程", "source_question_number": "12.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 113–116", "source_sha256": "99072ea99402992bc6be081a93f1d037d79b6498ee8133aa688339e08c43d4e5", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "3", "accepted_answers": ["3"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "3", "fingerprint": "7677c1703e5606af770a553f122d0357ce7a8dab7ec8bf57e2a3b2aff27b9376", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-42db33cf602ba3a4", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "(2)用二分法求方程ln x=2-x的近似解，最初选取的区间为[1，2]，要求精确度为0.01，则所需二分区间的次数最少为　　　　.", "explanation": "区间[1，2]的长度等于1，每经过一次操作，区间长度变为原来的一半，\n经过n(n∈N^(*))次此操作后，区间长度变为(1)/(2^(n)).\n要求精确度为0.01，所以(1)/(2^(n))<0.01，n∈N^(*).\n因为(1)/(2^(6))=(1)/(64)>0.01，(1)/(2^(7))=(1)/(128)<0.01，所以n≥7，即所需二分区间的次数最少为7.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K013", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["zero_analysis", "bisection"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.10　函数的零点与方程的解.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.10　函数的零点与方程的解", "source_question_number": "(2)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 69–74", "source_sha256": "7da9bcec0a87e2c967224ca7ddab30c91eb45feb64b580942293fc9a92808b12", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "7", "accepted_answers": ["7"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "7", "fingerprint": "c22d6625d4cdcbe7e6a5d1b9a3efa25ffc8311a5d7d49252ee312f82f28b6f65", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-4141fdcda33601e9", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "7.(2026·乌鲁木齐期中)已知函数f(x)=4^(x)-a·2^(x)+3(a∈R)在区间(0，2)上有两个零点，则实数a的取值范围为　　　　　　.", "explanation": "令t=2^(x)，因为x∈(0，2)，所以t∈(1，4)，\n则方程t^(2)-at+3=0在(1，4)内有2个根，\n即a=t+(3)/(t)在(1，4)内有2个解，\n即直线y=a与函数g(t)=t+(3)/(t)的图象在(1，4)内有2个交点，\n由对勾函数的性质可知，g(t)=t+(3)/(t)在(1，sqrt(3))上单调递减，在(sqrt(3)，4)上单调递增，\n又因为g(1)=4，g(sqrt(3))=2sqrt(3)，g(4)=(19)/(4)，\n所以2sqrt(3)<a<4，\n故实数a的取值范围为(2sqrt(3)，4).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K014", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.11　函数与方程的综合应用", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 162–171", "source_sha256": "7b1851320c542276a55bb3d4b6ab48c9f5e4effdf12980cb5cb95b9ae125d796", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(2sqrt(3),4)", "accepted_answers": ["(2sqrt(3),4)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(2sqrt(3)，4)", "fingerprint": "44ff10aa92f5ca8c8ffd3320a6e5db10516fa6726e85f96a7067b134b8a13365", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-83cc71923a0e2bf6", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "跟踪训练1　(1)函数y=(sqrt(−x^(2)−3x+4))/(lg(x+1))的定义域是　　　　　　　　.", "explanation": "函数y=(sqrt(−x^(2)−3x+4))/(lg(x+1))的定义域满足\n{−x^(2)−3x+4≥0,; lg(x+1)≠0,; x+1>0}⇒{−4≤x≤1,; x≠0,; x>−1,}解得-1<x<0或0<x≤1，\n所以函数的定义域为(-1，0)∪(0，1].", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K002", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示", "source_question_number": "跟踪训练1　(1)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 70–74", "source_sha256": "bfae8dfc6e13ba99cb9fbdb0e2a12574832dae6410fe637d5e24353e2a7730a1", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(-1,0)∪(0,1]", "accepted_answers": ["(-1,0)∪(0,1]"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(-1，0)∪(0，1]", "fingerprint": "72fe920b3631210a5425b0bd20075f56f833d94cc54ebd68a6cb7ec30f7f4bf6", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-93c9875568bede73", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "9.若函数f(x)=4|x-a|+3在区间[1，+∞)上不单调，则a的取值范围是　　　　　　.", "explanation": "因为函数f(x)=4|x-a|+3在(-∞，a)上单调递减，在(a，+∞)上单调递增，\n又函数f(x)在区间[1，+∞)上不单调，所以a>1.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "9.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 297–300", "source_sha256": "4a4da4a043a4a5f8afa3779129d634179d1dad121b475e710a0733c1cb0f34fb", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(1,+∞)", "accepted_answers": ["(1,+∞)"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "(1，+∞)", "fingerprint": "8cb1365a13e0d894e98f20f0de7bad8432dc323ca98531386e547f1ef1608e2c", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-8c26a254b0b1dfd7", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "(2)(人教B版必修第一册P115练习BT2改编)已知f(x)=x^(5)+ax^(3)+bx-8，且f(-2)=10，则f(2)=　　　　.", "explanation": "方法一　令g(x)=x^(5)+ax^(3)+bx，\n易知g(x)是R上的奇函数，从而g(-2)=-g(2)，又f(x)=g(x)-8，\n∴f(-2)=g(-2)-8=10，\n∴g(-2)=18，\n∴g(2)=-g(-2)=-18，\n∴f(2)=g(2)-8=-18-8=-26.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "(2)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 157–164", "source_sha256": "2b98749942d46405dc0feb9ed1acfc75b54a012461b9fd5891e462e26657f25e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "-26", "accepted_answers": ["-26"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "-26", "fingerprint": "1380f4de69186ed07fc65af40f28d8ceae93051f628dad98a5aa1a532a9f260f", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-9f5f6249e6aa004d", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "7.(2026·淮南模拟)函数f(x)=(x^(2)+2x)(x^(2)+ax+b)的图象关于直线x=1对称，则a+b=　　　.", "explanation": "因为函数f(x)=(x^(2)+2x)(x^(2)+ax+b)的图象关于直线x=1对称，所以f(1+x)=f(1-x)，\n所以{f(0)=f(2),; f(−1)=f(3),}\n即{0=8(4+2a+b),; −(1−a+b)=15(9+3a+b),}解得{a=−6,; b=8,}\n经检验，符合题意，所以a+b=2.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K006", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性", "source_question_number": "7.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 259–264", "source_sha256": "25d7a7bc92d4bc1b26b7b8da5051d6538bd27288a37b004ba4235b042f40b32f", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "2", "accepted_answers": ["2"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "2", "fingerprint": "e9f86a82ef152ac180341eca071ba90192c3f4a9a6309f0ed67d515e2cf99dd2", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-8346100aac0767b3", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "10.(2026·南阳模拟)若函数f(x)=x^(2)-2x+3在区间[m，n]上的值域为[2，18]，则n-m的最大值为　　　　.", "explanation": "因为函数f(x)=x^(2)-2x+3=(x-1)^(2)+2，\n所以当x=1时，f(x)有最小值f(1)=2，\n当f(x)=18，即x^(2)-2x+3=18时，解得x=-3或x=5，\n又当x∈[-3，1)时，f(x)单调递减，\n当x∈(1，5]时，f(x)单调递增，\n所以n的最大值为5，m的最小值为-3，\n所以n-m的最大值为5+3=8.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K004", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "10.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 301–309", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "8", "accepted_answers": ["8"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "8", "fingerprint": "267ab8015ca34cdbaf0f68631fddbd28a9e5404353eeaa3f5514093cafeffd09", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-f1a5a01a68638adc", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "(2)若a^((1)/(2))+a^(−(1)/(2))=3，则(a+a^(−1)−2)/(a^(2)+a^(−2)+3)=　　　　.", "explanation": "由a^((1)/(2))+a^(−(1)/(2))=3，\n等号两边平方得a+a^(-1)=7，\n等号两边再平方可得a^(2)+a^(-2)=47，\n所以(a+a^(−1)−2)/(a^(2)+a^(−2)+3)=(7−2)/(47+3)=(1)/(10).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K009", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数", "source_question_number": "(2)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 71–76", "source_sha256": "ec6f7661553cca7157518fc1cf4a9380542f8134559850d06c43bcbe2eb65b0e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(1)/(10)", "accepted_answers": ["(1)/(10)"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "(1)/(10)", "fingerprint": "681390072742db07b796dc27eb41fdfe7adfc9b90e224c0a6059a1ea5d59d71d", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-48f7fc84a81cd43b", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "(2)计算：2log_(3)2-log_(3)(16)/(9)+log_(3)20-log_(3)sqrt(75)=　　　　.", "explanation": "由题意可得2log_(3)2-log_(3)(16)/(9)+log_(3)20-log_(3)sqrt(75)\n=log_(3)4-log_(3)(16)/(9)+log_(3)20-log_(3)5sqrt(3)\n=log_(3)(4×20)/((16)/(9)×5sqrt(3))=log_(3)3sqrt(3)=(3)/(2).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K010", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数", "source_question_number": "(2)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 81–85", "source_sha256": "4e670ab7e922a6620ab14b5ad2aeb1b90cfc2e4a96ce6e02f27dd7d3508f9568", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "(3)/(2)", "accepted_answers": ["(3)/(2)"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "(3)/(2)", "fingerprint": "3a499e212df227060b70cda386038fa847d131095420e48150f84324db7a9bea", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-361f7d2905c8fe7d", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "12.已知函数f(x)={log_(3)(x+1),x>1,; x,0<x≤1,}若f(m)=2，则m=　　　　.", "explanation": "当0<x≤1时，0<f(x)=x≤1<2，所以若f(m)=2，只能m>1，即log_(3)(m+1)=2，所以m+1=3^(2)=9，所以m=8>1，满足题意.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K010", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题2　函数的概念与性质", "source_question_number": "12.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 135–137", "source_sha256": "8a3090a0ac7a0b0ea1eb450da245b9f84fa595720e72110c6519840779682806", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "8", "accepted_answers": ["8"], "answer_type": "numeric", "raw_answer": "8", "fingerprint": "d7e28c3dd5a1f57fe7c391c8c7f673a9003a2b0c3cb53c24afc793fc47c33015", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
{"id": "FF-dd7d16373d985ca0", "question_type": "fill_blank", "stem": "14.已知定义在R上的函数f(x)=x^(2)-2tx+1在(-∞，1]上单调递减，且对任意的x_(1)，x_(2)∈[0，t+1]，总有|f(x_(1))-f(x_(2))|≤2，则实数t的取值范围是　　　　.", "explanation": "二次函数f(x)=x^(2)-2tx+1=(x-t)^(2)-t^(2)+1图象的对称轴为直线x=t，\n所以f(x)在(-∞，t]上单调递减，在(t，+∞)上单调递增，\n又已知f(x)在(-∞，1]上单调递减，可得t≥1.\n因为函数f(x)在[0，t]上单调递减，在(t，t+1]上单调递增，\n又t-0≥1，t+1-t=1，\n由对称性可知f(0)≥f(t+1)，所以当x=0时，f(x)在[0，t+1]上取得最大值，最大值为f(0)=1；\n当x=t时，f(x)在[0，t+1]上取得最小值，最小值为f(t)=-t^(2)+1，要使对任意的x_(1)，x_(2)∈[0，t+1]，都有|f(x_(1))-f(x_(2))|≤2，\n只要f(x)_(max)-f(x)_(min)≤2成立即可，\n所以f(x)_(max)-f(x)_(min)=1-(-t^(2)+1)≤2，\n解得-sqrt(2)≤t≤sqrt(2)，\n又t≥1，所以1≤t≤sqrt(2)，\n即t的取值范围为[1，sqrt(2)].", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K007"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K007"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　必刷小题3　基本初等函数", "source_question_number": "14.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 128–141", "source_sha256": "e787e0fd585e547b1af86d7e786b3f1449f337a3875adc1e700bbca67406f78d", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "reviewed", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "pending_review", "answer_expression": "[1,sqrt(2)]", "accepted_answers": ["[1,sqrt(2)]"], "answer_type": "interval", "raw_answer": "[1，sqrt(2)]", "fingerprint": "7377ee65a7e5c91b0f866de39fdbdf3b8ff4bd37919b049f8fcb33889e6d6b3f", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": []}
